title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/recent:open
catalog: GUI command
target: recent:open
summary: Recent: open the highlighted metarecord (here / other / new)

!! Reference

* Defined by the ``recent`` panel

!! Default keys

* ``b enter`` → ``recent:open new`` (in the ``recent`` panel)
* ``enter`` → ``recent:open other`` (in the ``recent`` panel)
* ``i enter`` → ``recent:open here`` (in the ``recent`` panel)
* ``right`` → ``recent:open other`` (in the ``recent`` panel)
